    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>How to export Measurement captured with the SDK.</para>
<para>A handle for each of the exporter can be obtainend by calling either <ref refid="group__cuvis__exporter_1gac8dbccda0642d3ed2cbcf432ab699712" kindref="member">cuvis_exporter_create_cube</ref>, <ref refid="group__cuvis__exporter_1ga059d334204d89ce35d46d8f3a58f8ea1" kindref="member">cuvis_exporter_create_envi</ref>, <ref refid="group__cuvis__exporter_1ga11c92466098f336746a7c12f1b47e73d" kindref="member">cuvis_exporter_create_tiff</ref> or <ref refid="group__cuvis__exporter_1ga0563d72ab50f589a7737b8213e915952" kindref="member">cuvis_exporter_create_view</ref>. Each of the so created exporter can then export a <ref refid="group__cuvis__mesu" kindref="compound">Measurement</ref> to the respective format by calling <ref refid="group__cuvis__exporter_1ga6f0c3dbfef8cfb65159d9ee47786aa6b" kindref="member">cuvis_exporter_apply</ref>. Each exporter takes options in form of <ref refid="structcuvis__export__general__settings__t" kindref="compound">cuvis_export_general_settings_t</ref> and one of the following format specific structs <ref refid="structcuvis__save__args__t" kindref="compound">cuvis_save_args_t</ref>, <ref refid="structcuvis__export__view__settings__t" kindref="compound">cuvis_export_view_settings_t</ref>, <ref refid="structcuvis__export__tiff__settings__t" kindref="compound">cuvis_export_tiff_settings_t</ref></para>
<para>See the respective struct documentations for more information on the individual options </para>
    </detaileddescription>
  </compounddef>
